{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/SteamTextHeader1.png?t=1744872792\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/FrogsLineup.gif?t=1744872792\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From tiny tadpoles to massive walking juggernauts, frogrammers fill a broad spectrum of offensive, defensive and supportive roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire a frogrammer once and watch them battle on your side until...until you have to lay them off, of course</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/SteamTextHeader2.png?t=1744872792\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/EpicBattle.gif?t=1744872792\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The bugs get ever stranger and ever more numerous. Deploy your frogs strategically and manage your economy wisely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through a variety of different scenarios with unique challenges and pitfalls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/SteamTextHeader3.png?t=1744872792\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/HeadSpinningOpening.gif?t=1744872792\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore different combinations and synergies, no frogrammer can succeed alone!</p></l